{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/ConjunctivePre.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.isConjunctiveInPosts\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">SpecAttr</span>.<span class=\"name\">isConjunctiveInPosts</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">concl</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">binders</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether the spec's precondition is conjunctive in its schematic postconditions (`Q` and/or `E`):\neach occurs only in conjunctive contexts, and in no premise nor in the program. The `binders` are the\nspec's `∀`-telescoped parameters and premises. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/ConjunctivePre.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.isConjunctiveInPosts","kind":"def","line":143,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.SpecAttr.isConjunctiveInPosts","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/ConjunctivePre.lean#L143-L155"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Basic","Std.Internal.Do.Triple.Basic"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.ConjunctivePre"}